{"title":"Python网络爬虫：深入理解Requests库的GET请求","slug":"2024-07-26-requests_get请求","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-requests_get请求.json","excerpt":"前言在 Python 网络爬虫开发中，requests 库因其简洁优雅的 API 设计，成为了最主流的 HTTP 请求库。相比于标准库 urllib，它极大地简化了请求流程。本文将通过一个具体的案例——模拟百度搜索“北京”，来深入讲解 requests.get() 的核心用法及注意事项。","covers":null,"content":"<h3 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h3><p>在 Python 网络爬虫开发中，<code>requests</code> 库因其简洁优雅的 API 设计，成为了最主流的 HTTP 请求库。相比于标准库 <code>urllib</code>，它极大地简化了请求流程。</p>\n<p>本文将通过一个具体的案例——模拟百度搜索“北京”，来深入讲解 <code>requests.get()</code> 的核心用法及注意事项。</p>\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\n<h3 id=\"核心代码实现\"><a href=\"#核心代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码实现\"></a>核心代码实现</h3><p>下面是一个完整的 GET 请求示例，包含了 URL 构造、请求头伪装及参数传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义基础 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com/s?&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 定制请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36 Edge/16.16299&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 定义查询参数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;北京&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 发送 GET 请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：使用 params 参数自动处理参数拼接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(url=url, params=data, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 设置响应编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response.encoding = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 输出响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 关键技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在使用 `requests` 发送带参数的 GET 请求时，有几个核心细节需要掌握：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 1. 参数自动化处理 (`params` 参数)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">在代码中，我们将查询参数封装在字典 `data` 中，并通过 `params=data` 传递。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **自动 URL 编码**：`requests` 会自动对参数进行 URL 编码，开发者无需手动调用 `urllib.parse.urlencode`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **自动拼接**：库会自动将参数拼接到 URL 后面，开发者无需在 URL 中手动拼接 `?` 和 `&amp;` 符号。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 2. 请求头定制 (`headers` 参数)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">为了防止被目标网站的反爬虫机制拦截，必须模拟浏览器的行为。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在 `headers` 字典中添加 `User-Agent` 字段，可以将爬虫伪装成主流浏览器（如 Chrome、Edge）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 3. 响应内容编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- `response.text` 是根据推测的编码自动解码后的字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 如果网页返回的内容出现乱码，通常是因为推测编码不准确。此时可以通过 `response.encoding = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>` 显式指定编码格式，确保中文正常显示。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过对比原生 `urllib` 库，使用 `requests` 发送 GET 请求的优势显而易见：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> **参数使用 `params` 参数**：代码语义更清晰。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> **无须手动编码**：内部自动完成 URL Encode。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span> **无须请求对象定制**：直接通过函数参数传递配置，代码更紧凑。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握这些基础用法，是进行复杂爬虫开发的第一步。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 优化说明：</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **格式修复**：原文中的代码块包含了大量的 HTML 实体编码（如 `&amp;<span class=\"comment\">#x27;` 代表单引号），导致代码无法直接运行。我已将其还原为标准的 Python 代码。</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **结构化调整**：将文章分为“前言”、“核心代码实现”、“关键技术点解析”和“总结”四个部分，逻辑递进，便于读者理解。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **内容增强**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   为代码添加了详细的注释。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   针对 `params` 参数、URL 编码、请求头伪装等技术点进行了深入解读。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   解释了为什么需要设置 `response.encoding`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **SEO 优化**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   完善了 `tags`、`categories` 和 `keywords`，有助于搜索引擎收录。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   标题修改得更具体、更具吸引力。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  **Hexo 适配**：添加了 `&lt;!-- more --&gt;` 标签，确保在博客首页只显示摘要，优化阅读体验。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h3 id=\"核心代码实现\"><a href=\"#核心代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心代码实现\"></a>核心代码实现</h3><p>下面是一个完整的 GET 请求示例，包含了 URL 构造、请求头伪装及参数传递：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义基础 URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://www.baidu.com/s?&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 定制请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.36 Edge/16.16299&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 定义查询参数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;wd&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;北京&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 发送 GET 请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 注意：使用 params 参数自动处理参数拼接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(url=url, params=data, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 5. 设置响应编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response.encoding = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 6. 输出响应内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 关键技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在使用 `requests` 发送带参数的 GET 请求时，有几个核心细节需要掌握：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 1. 参数自动化处理 (`params` 参数)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">在代码中，我们将查询参数封装在字典 `data` 中，并通过 `params=data` 传递。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **自动 URL 编码**：`requests` 会自动对参数进行 URL 编码，开发者无需手动调用 `urllib.parse.urlencode`。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **自动拼接**：库会自动将参数拼接到 URL 后面，开发者无需在 URL 中手动拼接 `?` 和 `&amp;` 符号。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 2. 请求头定制 (`headers` 参数)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">为了防止被目标网站的反爬虫机制拦截，必须模拟浏览器的行为。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 在 `headers` 字典中添加 `User-Agent` 字段，可以将爬虫伪装成主流浏览器（如 Chrome、Edge）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 3. 响应内容编码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- `response.text` 是根据推测的编码自动解码后的字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- 如果网页返回的内容出现乱码，通常是因为推测编码不准确。此时可以通过 `response.encoding = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>` 显式指定编码格式，确保中文正常显示。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">通过对比原生 `urllib` 库，使用 `requests` 发送 GET 请求的优势显而易见：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span> **参数使用 `params` 参数**：代码语义更清晰。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span> **无须手动编码**：内部自动完成 URL Encode。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span> **无须请求对象定制**：直接通过函数参数传递配置，代码更紧凑。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">掌握这些基础用法，是进行复杂爬虫开发的第一步。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 优化说明：</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **格式修复**：原文中的代码块包含了大量的 HTML 实体编码（如 `&amp;<span class=\"comment\">#x27;` 代表单引号），导致代码无法直接运行。我已将其还原为标准的 Python 代码。</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **结构化调整**：将文章分为“前言”、“核心代码实现”、“关键技术点解析”和“总结”四个部分，逻辑递进，便于读者理解。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **内容增强**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   为代码添加了详细的注释。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   针对 `params` 参数、URL 编码、请求头伪装等技术点进行了深入解读。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   解释了为什么需要设置 `response.encoding`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **SEO 优化**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   完善了 `tags`、`categories` 和 `keywords`，有助于搜索引擎收录。</span><br><span class=\"line\">    *   标题修改得更具体、更具吸引力。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  **Hexo 适配**：添加了 `&lt;!-- more --&gt;` 标签，确保在博客首页只显示摘要，优化阅读体验。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Python爬虫开发","path":"api/categories/Python爬虫开发.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"Requests","path":"api/tags/Requests.json"},{"name":"爬虫","path":"api/tags/爬虫.json"}]}